# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Per-type sigma and epsilon tunable on a table with an NBFIX of
# [ nonbond_params ] (D213, maintainer's decision on PR #159):
# the pair CT-OW keeps its values, and an update during a run equals, to the
# bit, a compile with the rule's values for the other pairs and the NBFIX's
# own.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide nbfix GPU Double | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide nbfix GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU {{Double|Mixed}}: NBFIX kept: an update at step 6 and 10 steps equal a compile with the new values from that state to the bit
# CHECK: nbfix passed
